	quest.52B1BDEF1F613B52.quest_desc: [
		"A &echarm&r that, when you attack a target, will automatically cast a linked &e\"Touch\"&r &bspell&r (up to 10 components, starting with &e'Touch'&r) on the attacked enemy."
